    - target: {fileID: 8645396583276102610, guid: 19a66575dd114224fb309114d19c551e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: "\"The blood altar\u2019s servants are bound to it. ||Slay them, burn
        them, scatter their bones\u2014it matters not.|| <color=#950000><b>The Blood
        Pact ensures they will rise again,</b></color> their hollow eyes gleaming
        with borrowed life. ||Only the curse\u2019s demise can break this cycle.
        Until then, <b>the fallen will forever return</b> to guard its halls.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
